flowchart LR
  dev([Developer push]) --> gl
  subgraph gl[GitLab project]
    direction TB
    ci[CI pipeline<br/>lint · tests · security]
    can[canary:local-evaluate<br/>candidate vs stable,<br/>real HTTP traffic]
    rb[rollback --local<br/>stop candidate, probe stable]
    ev[evidence:collect<br/>redacted bundle + SHA-256]
    duo[GitLab Duo flow<br/>investigator → repairer]
    mr[Repair MR<br/>fix + regression test + analysis.json]
    gates[gate:regression-proof<br/>gate:integrity-gate]
    ci --> can
    can -- breach --> rb --> ev
    ev -. pipeline failed trigger .-> duo --> mr --> gates
    gates -- both pass --> merge[Merge by a person<br/>or auto-merge]
    merge --> ci
  end
  can -- HMAC-signed events --> be
  rb -- events --> be
  ev -- events --> be
  gates -- verdicts --> be
  mr -. MR webhook .-> be
  merge -. merge webhook .-> be
  be[(Sentinel backend<br/>FastAPI · SQLite<br/>evidence-gated state machine)]
  ui[Mission Control<br/>React · read-only] -- GET /api/v1/* --> be
